==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|chandelerie|lang=frm}}, from {{term|chandelier|lang=frm}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|chandleries}}

# The art or trade of [[candle]]-making.
# A business, shop or warehouse used in [[candle]]-making.
# An operation (usually, a business) which provides supplies.
# The [[merchandise]] of a chandler.

